  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it varies, but most times even in low poly worlds, when I call up the menu and navigate and scroll, there's enough jitter to make me motion sick.  I'm more sensitive to it than most, but I think it's being made worse when I'm looking for new places to visit, just those moments when my eyes are trying to focus on menu options and it's not smooth.  Is this just because it's a lot of work for the system to populate these lists?  It really would improve my vr experience though if that could be solved.",
